  "description": "Sundown is the ninth studio album by Canadian singer Gordon Lightfoot, released in 1974 on Reprise Records. It was the only Lightfoot album to reach No. 1 on the pop chart in the US. In his native Canada, it topped the RPM 100 for five consecutive weeks, first hitting No. 1 on June 22, 1974, the same day it reached the top of the chart south of the border.",
